msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertionCategory|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Assertion Category"
msgstr "断言类别"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertionCategory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The kind of assertion a claim is — a value vocabulary (individuals, never subclasses) that says what the claim is, not how well it is supported: a self-description by the subject of the claim, a statement resting on externally published evidence, or a derived interpretation inferred or computed from other statements. A category classifies a claim and never ranks it; claims of different categories about the same matter are co-equal and coexist (Principle 9). It is a different axis from gmeow:EvidenceClass, which grades the warrant of one citation, and the two may differ: a self-description may cite an official source."
msgstr "声明所属的断言种类——一个值词汇表（由个体构成，绝不使用子类），说明声明是什么，而不是它得到多大程度的支持：声明主体的自我描述、依赖外部公开证据的陈述，或由其他陈述推断或计算得出的派生解释。类别只对声明分类，从不为其排序；就同一事项而言，不同类别的声明地位平等并共存（原则 9）。它与 gmeow:EvidenceClass 是不同的维度，后者评定单条引用的依据强度，二者可以不同：自我描述可以引用官方来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertionCategory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:assertionCategory gmeow:assertionCategorySelfDescription ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:assertionCategory gmeow:assertionCategorySelfDescription ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertionCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using it to rank or filter claims by trust, to restate the evidence class of the citations a claim rests on (that is gmeow:hasEvidenceClass on each gmeow:CitationAct), or to mint per-category subclasses; the categories are individuals."
msgstr "避免用它按可信度为声明排序或过滤，避免用它重述声明所依赖引用的证据类别（那是每个 gmeow:CitationAct 上的 gmeow:hasEvidenceClass），也避免为每个类别创建子类；各类别都是个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertionCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference one of the seeded individuals through gmeow:assertionCategory on the claim's statement reifier or claim record; mint a new individual with a label and definition only for a kind of assertion that none of the seeded ones covers."
msgstr "在声明的陈述具体化节点或声明记录上，通过 gmeow:assertionCategory 引用预置个体之一；只有当预置个体都不涵盖某种断言时，才创建带标签和定义的新个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertionCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use as the value vocabulary behind gmeow:assertionCategory — naming whether a claim is the subject's own description, rests on published evidence, or is a derived interpretation."
msgstr "用作 gmeow:assertionCategory 的值词汇表——说明一条声明是主体自己的描述、依赖公开证据，还是派生解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategory|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "assertion category"
msgstr "断言类别"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The category of the assertion a claim makes — self-description, published evidence or derived interpretation — stated on the claim itself, whether that claim is a statement reifier or a claim record. It has no domain class because a reifier has none. Non-functional: competing categorisations by different standpoints coexist, and a claim that is both a self-description and a derived interpretation carries both. It is independent of gmeow:hasEvidenceClass: no category follows from the evidence classes of a claim's citations and none implies them."
msgstr "声明所作断言的类别——自我描述、公开证据或派生解释——直接写在声明本身上，无论该声明是陈述具体化节点还是声明记录。它没有定义域类，因为具体化节点没有类。非函数性：不同立场的相互竞争的归类并存，既是自我描述又是派生解释的声明同时带有两者。它独立于 gmeow:hasEvidenceClass：类别不由声明引用的证据类别推出，也不蕴含这些证据类别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:claim gmeow:assertionCategory gmeow:assertionCategoryPublishedEvidence ."
msgstr "ex:claim gmeow:assertionCategory gmeow:assertionCategoryPublishedEvidence ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using it as a rank, a trust level or a display flag, avoid reading the evidence classes of a claim's citations off it, and avoid forcing one value; it is non-functional (Principle 9)."
msgstr "避免把它当作排名、可信度等级或显示标志，避免据此推读声明引用的证据类别，也避免强制只取一个值；它是非函数性的（原则 9）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Annotate the claim's statement reifier with one or more gmeow:AssertionCategory individuals; keep the evidence class on each gmeow:CitationAct the claim rests on, and let claims of different categories coexist without ordering."
msgstr "用一个或多个 gmeow:AssertionCategory 个体标注声明的陈述具体化节点；证据类别仍保留在声明所依赖的每个 gmeow:CitationAct 上，并让不同类别的声明不分先后地共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to say, on the claim itself, what kind of assertion it is, so a consumer can list or select claims by category without inspecting their citations."
msgstr "用于在声明本身上说明它属于哪种断言，使使用方无需检查引用即可按类别列出或选取声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategoryDerivedInterpretation|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "derived interpretation"
msgstr "派生解释"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategoryDerivedInterpretation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The claim is an interpretation inferred or computed from other statements rather than stated by its subject or read from a source; it is the claim-level counterpart of an observation typed gmeow:observationTypeDerived, and the statements it was derived from are carried by its provenance."
msgstr "该声明是由其他陈述推断或计算得出的解释，而不是由其主体陈述或从来源中读取；它是类型为 gmeow:observationTypeDerived 的观测在声明层面的对应物，其所依据的陈述由它的出处记录携带。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategoryPublishedEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "published evidence"
msgstr "公开证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategoryPublishedEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The claim is a statement that rests on externally published evidence: the claim reports what a source outside the claim's own standpoint says, and each such source is cited through a gmeow:CitationAct that carries its own gmeow:hasEvidenceClass."
msgstr "该声明是依赖外部公开证据的陈述：它转述声明自身立场之外的某个来源所说的内容，每个这样的来源都通过带有自身 gmeow:hasEvidenceClass 的 gmeow:CitationAct 被引用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategorySelfDescription|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "self-description"
msgstr "自我描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertionCategorySelfDescription|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The claim is a description of the subject made by the subject itself. Its citations may still carry any evidence class, so a self-description that cites an official source is both this category and gmeow:evidenceOfficialSource on that citation; the category and the evidence class answer different questions, and gmeow:evidenceSELF on a citation does not by itself make a claim a self-description."
msgstr "该声明是主体对自身所作的描述。它的引用仍可带有任何证据类别，因此引用官方来源的自我描述既属于本类别，其引用上又带有 gmeow:evidenceOfficialSource；类别与证据类别回答的是不同的问题，引用上的 gmeow:evidenceSELF 本身并不使声明成为自我描述。"
